      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/thomasville/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the 1950s, Thomasville opened an FPS‑35 radar base as part of the Air Defense Command’s SAGE system, drawing servicemen and families.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
